## K-SYNTH PARAMETER CREATION (Bass Filter Sweep Stream)
# Synthesize 32-step exponential sweep (750 Hz -> 3600 Hz) directly into /SS 12:
[750 * ((3600%750) ^ ((!32)%31))] k! k>d /SS 12

